WEBVTT

00:05:26.568 --> 00:05:30.208
with all these societal challenges?

00:05:30.208 --> 00:05:33.324
Well there, I think the answer is very clear:

00:05:33.324 --> 00:05:37.010
They're in business.

00:05:37.010 --> 00:05:42.621
All wealth is actually created by business.

00:05:42.621 --> 00:05:45.347
Business creates wealth

00:05:45.347 --> 00:05:50.393
when it meets needs at a profit.

00:05:50.393 --> 00:05:52.857
That's how all wealth is created.

00:05:52.857 --> 00:05:55.230
It's meeting needs at a profit

00:05:55.230 --> 00:05:57.642
that leads to taxes

00:05:57.642 --> 00:05:59.311
and that leads to incomes

00:05:59.311 --> 00:06:01.578
and that leads to charitable donations.